,"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","commit_id":"2f78cc5c86cb070eb25051e73a1bbcf8d970d6df","state":"approved","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3265#pullrequestreview-4280715492","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3265","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3265#pullrequestreview-4280715492"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3265"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-13T10:41:32Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T12:29:11Z","author_association":"OWNER","event":"reviewed"},{"sha":"1b80ff1484173b7672e462c34dce24bdc3b5a858","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDFiODBmZjE0ODQxNzNiNzY3MmU0NjJjMzRkY2UyNGJkYzNiNWE4NTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/1b80ff1484173b7672e462c34dce24bdc3b5a858","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/1b80ff1484173b7672e462c34dce24bdc3b5a858","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T09:53:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T12:24:02Z"},"tree":{"sha":"0102e5c0a8fc6884c8a9a713fcfe060c0b6ede46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/0102e5c0a8fc6884c8a9a713fcfe060c0b6ede46"},"message":"types: persist Node JSON slices via named IsZero types\n\nEndpoints, Tags and ApprovedRoutes serialize as JSON on Node. GORM's\nstruct Updates path skips fields it considers zero, and reflect treats\na nil slice as zero — clearing any of these columns via the State\npersist path would leave the previous value in the database.\n\nIntroduce Strings, Prefixes and AddrPorts as named slice types whose\nIsZero() always reports false, so GORM keeps the column in the UPDATE\nregardless of the slice being nil or empty. JSON marshalling is\nunchanged: nil serializes to null, empty to []. List() returns the\nunderlying unnamed slice for callers (mainly testify assertions over\nreflect.DeepEqual) that distinguish the named type from its base.\n\nRegenerated types_clone.go and types_view.go follow the field-type\nswap. Test assertions across hscontrol/{db,state,servertest} updated\nto call .List() where reflect.DeepEqual previously matched the raw\nslice type.\n\nFixes #3110","parents":[{"sha":"5d502bfb8836b8fd09fb284f6ff494527e11098a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/5d502bfb8836b8fd09fb284f6ff494527e11098a","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/5d502bfb8836b8fd09fb284f6ff494527e11098a"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"f892d8e9da583a8219f4b4f01e225ebf734f6a91","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGY4OTJkOGU5ZGE1ODNhODIxOWY0YjRmMDFlMjI1ZWJmNzM0ZjZhOTE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f892d8e9da583a8219f4b4f01e225ebf734f6a91","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f892d8e9da583a8219f4b4f01e225ebf734f6a91","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T09:53:11Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T12:24:02Z"},"tree":{"sha":"35aa4668ede1142a9221f3074a64c69eb5e5e068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/35aa4668ede1142a9221f3074a64c69eb5e5e068"},"message":"state: add regression test for Node slice persistence\n\nDrives the persist path for ApprovedRoutes, Tags and Endpoints —\nseed a non-empty value, clear to nil, read the column back from disk,\nthen close the State and reopen one against the same sqlite file to\nsimulate a server restart. Pins the contract the named IsZero slice\ntypes enforce so future changes to the persist path cannot silently\ndrop a cleared slice column.\n\nUpdates #3110","parents":[{"sha":"1b80ff1484173b7672e462c34dce24bdc3b5a858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/1b80ff1484173b7672e462c34dce24bdc3b5a858","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/1b80ff1484173b7672e462c34dce24bdc3b5a858"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"2f78cc5c86cb070eb25051e73a1bbcf8d970d6df","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDJmNzhjYzVjODZjYjA3MGViMjUwNTFlNzNhMWJiY2Y4ZDk3MGQ2ZGY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2f78cc5c86cb070eb25051e73a1bbcf8d970d6df","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2f78cc5c86cb070eb25051e73a1bbcf8d970d6df","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T09:53:21Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T12:24:02Z"},"tree":{"sha":"65ec77e342851fcc644a296cd3feff275819888a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/65ec77e342851fcc644a296cd3feff275819888a"},"message":"db: remove unused SetApprovedRoutes and SetTags helpers\n\nBoth helpers existed to write the literal \"[]\" when clearing a slice\ncolumn — a workaround for GORM's struct-Updates skipping nil slices.\nThe State path goes exclusively through persistNodeToDB, which is now\ncorrect end-to-end thanks to the named IsZero slice types, so the\nhelpers are dead in production. The remaining callers were tests.\n\nTestSetTags is dropped — TestSetTags_* in hscontrol/grpcv1_test.go\nalready covers the State path that production uses. TestAutoApproveRoutes\nnow writes routes via DB.Save on the loaded node, which is the path\ngRPC SetApprovedRoutes drives in production.\n\nUpdates #3110","parents":[{"sha":"f892d8e9da583a8219f4b4f01e225ebf734f6a91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f892d8e9da583a8219f4b4f01e225ebf734f6a91","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f892d8e9da583a8219f4b4f01e225ebf734f6a91"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":25481037808,"node_id":"RRE_lADOEFLz888AAAABCHSmrc8AAAAF7snH8A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25481037808","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"review_requested","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-05-13T12:24:18Z","review_requester":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_ur